  "id": 1286,
  "description": "Please join our discord for guides, giveaways, or just chatting with members!\n            **Rules for all**\n1. Just enjoy the game and remember it&#039;s just a game\n2. There&#039;s no pressure here, real life comes first. Everyone has a busy schedule\n3. Raids are Saurdays and Sundays. Saturday is for the lowest Combat level and Sundays are for the highest Combat level players\n4. We won&#039;t give you anything, but we will show and help you obtain it\n5. Yes there&#039;s a leader, but we all get a say! We will hear your input and decide accordingly.\n6. We do have Discord if you would like to chat members, need help, or anything else, but it isn&#039;t mandatory. If not, then comment at the bottom of members&#039; profile\n7. Donate, it doesn&#039;t matter how much or what it is. If you want to know what the guild needs, check blueprints or ask CajunGator or Dagger\n8. Please try to be active, if I see you&#039;re playing at least once or twice a week, that&#039;s fine. I don&#039;t want to kick anyone, but after 2 weeks of inactivity is when I kick people",
